{"name":"Majorelle Gardens","hex":"#337766","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"gardens","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of garden"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["third-person singular simple present indicative of garden"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/gardens"}],"entries":[{"title":"Majorelle Garden","blocks":[{"text":"The Majorelle Garden is a one-hectare (two-acre) botanical garden and artist's landscape garden in Marrakesh, Morocco. It was created by the French Orientalist artist Jacques Majorelle over almost forty years, starting in 1923, and features a Cubist villa designed by French architect Paul Sinoir in the 1930s. The property was the residence of the artist and his wife from 1923 until their divorce in the 1950s."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c2/Le_jardin_des_majorelle_40.JPG/330px-Le_jardin_des_majorelle_40.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Majorelle_Garden","wikidata":"Q1395431"},{"title":"Garden","blocks":[{"text":"A garden is a planned space, usually outdoors, set aside for the cultivation, display, and enjoyment of plants and other forms of nature. The single feature identifying even the wildest wild garden is control. The garden can incorporate both natural and artificial materials."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Brooklyn_Botanic_Garden_New_York_May_2015_010.jpg/330px-Brooklyn_Botanic_Garden_New_York_May_2015_010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Garden","wikidata":"Q1107656"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Majorelle_Garden.jpg/500px-Majorelle_Garden.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Majorelle_Garden.jpg/1280px-Majorelle_Garden.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Majorelle_Garden.jpg/500px-Majorelle_Garden.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Majorelle Garden's cactus collection, with Villa in the background","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMajorelle_Garden.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/Marrakech_Majorelle_Garden_2011.jpg/500px-Marrakech_Majorelle_Garden_2011.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/Marrakech_Majorelle_Garden_2011.jpg/1280px-Marrakech_Majorelle_Garden_2011.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/Marrakech_Majorelle_Garden_2011.jpg/500px-Marrakech_Majorelle_Garden_2011.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"An example of Majorelle Blue from the house in the garden","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMarrakech_Majorelle_Garden_2011.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/D%C3%A9tail_d%27un_mur%2C_Jardin_Majorelle%2C_Marrakech.jpg/120px-D%C3%A9tail_d%27un_mur%2C_Jardin_Majorelle%2C_Marrakech.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/D%C3%A9tail_d%27un_mur%2C_Jardin_Majorelle%2C_Marrakech.jpg/250px-D%C3%A9tail_d%27un_mur%2C_Jardin_Majorelle%2C_Marrakech.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/D%C3%A9tail_d%27un_mur%2C_Jardin_Majorelle%2C_Marrakech.jpg/120px-D%C3%A9tail_d%27un_mur%2C_Jardin_Majorelle%2C_Marrakech.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":""